      "content": "i don't even know how to explain it. it just feels like there's no point anymore. like i've done all i can do and i'm just stuck in this loop. sometimes i just sit there thinking how much easier it would be if i didn't have to wake up and do it all over again. if i could just... stop. just stop everything.",
